<title>UK: HORSE RACING-GRAND NATIONAL RUNNERS AND RIDERS.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-GRAND NATIONAL RUNNERS AND RIDERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Runners and riders for the</p>
<p>re-scheduled Aintree Grand National steeplechase to be run on</p>
<p>Monday at 1600 GMT (tabulate under latest form, horse, trainer,</p>
<p>jockey):</p>
<p> P32-P   Master Oats	 (K.Bailey)	N.Williamson</p>
<p> 6P2P    Nahthen Lad	 (J.Pitman)	J.Titley</p>
<p> 4-335   Lo Stregone	 (T.Tate)	  G.Bradley</p>
<p> S1-51   Suny Bay	    (C.Brooks)	J.Osborne</p>
<p> 2605    Feathered Gale    (A.Moore)	 F.Woods</p>
<p> 25-3U   Avro Anson	  (M.Camacho)     P.Niven</p>
<p> 5/-1P2  Belmont King	(P.Nicholls)    R.Johnson</p>
<p> 10-P0   Buckboard Bounce  (G.Richards)    P.Carberry</p>
<p> 241P    Bishops Hall	(R.Alner)	 M.Richards</p>
<p> 1112    Lord Gyllene	(S.Brookshaw)   A.Dobbin</p>
<p> U-021   Wylde Hide	  (A.Moore)	 C.Swan</p>
<p> 114P    Dextra Dove	 (S.Earle)	 C.Maude</p>
<p> 1551    Antonin	     (S.Bramall)     C.O'Dwyer</p>
<p> F12-P   Smith's Band	(J.Pitman)	R.Dunwoody</p>
<p> 1300    New Co		(M.Morris)	D.Casey</p>
<p> 21F4    Go Ballistic	(J.O'Shea)	M.Fitzgerald</p>
<p> F2-14   General Wolfe     (T.Forster)     L.Wyer</p>
<p> 2232    Glemot		(K.Bailey)	S.McNeil</p>
<p> 2553    Valiant Warrior   (M.Hammond)     R.Garritty</p>
<p> 5344    Killeshin	   (H.Manners)     S.Curran</p>
<p> 225U    Straight Talk     (P.Nicholls)    J.Tizzard</p>
<p> F01P    Nuaffe		(P.Fahy)	  T.Mitchell</p>
<p> 1-320   Northern Hide     (M.Salaman)     P.Holley</p>
<p> 1441    Turning Trix	(D.Nicholson)   J.Kavanagh</p>
<p> 223F    River Mandate     (T.Forster)     A.Thornton</p>
<p> U5P0    Grange Brake	(N.Davies)	D.Walsh</p>
<p> 1142    Evangelica	  (M.Pipe)	  R.Supple</p>
<p> 4004    Back Bar	    (A.Moore)	 T.Treacy</p>
<p> 0/240   Dakyns Boy	  (N.Davies)	T.Murphy</p>
<p> 4-05F   Scribbler	   (G.McCourt)     D.Fortt</p>
<p> 12-P4   Celtic Abbey	(V.Williams)    B.Powell</p>
<p> 3F33    Full Of Oats	(H.Knight)	J.Culloty</p>
<p> P-246   Camelot Knight    (N.Davies)	C.Llewellyn</p>
<p> 2-045   Mugoni Beach	(M.Pipe)	  G.Thormey</p>
<p> 40-60   Over The Stream   (M.Milligan)    A.Smith</p>
<p> P/1FP-  Don't Light Up    (V.Williams)    R.Thornton</p>
<p> 10P6    Pink Gin	    (M.Hammond)     C.Bonner</p>
<p> 3B33    Spuffington	 (J.Gifford)     P.Hide</p>
<p>Note: All carry 10 stone (66.3 kilos) except Master Oats</p>
<p>(76.4 kilos), Nahthen Lad (67.7), Lo Stregone (65.4), Feathered</p>
<p>Gale (65), Suny Bay (65), Avro Anson (64.5), Bishops Hall (64)</p>
<p>and Buckboard Bounce (64)</p>
<p>Non-runners: Master Boston, Plastic Spaceage,</p>
<p>Doubtful: Belmont King, Over The Stream</p>
<p>Race distance: 4-1/2 miles (7.2 kms)</p>
<p>Value to winner: 178,148 pounds sterling ($285,000)</p>
<p>Latest betting: 10 to 1 Suny Bay, Lord Gyllene, Wylde Hide,</p>
<p>Avro Anson and Go Ballistic, 12-1 Lo Stregone and Smith's Band,</p>
<p>14-1 General Wolve, 16-1 Antonin and Nahthen Lad, 25-1 Buckboard</p>
<p>Bounce, 33-1 Feathered Gale, Belmont King, Killeshin, Master</p>
<p>Oats, Dextra Dove and Turning Trix, 40-1 Evangelica, New Co,</p>
<p>River Mandate and Valiant Warrior, 50-1 Bishops Hall, Glemot and</p>
<p>Northern Hide,</p>
<p>66-1 Back Bar, Full of Oats, Grange Brake, Mugoni Beach and</p>
<p>Straight Talk, 100-1 Camelot Knight, Celtic Abbey, Dakyns Boy,</p>
<p>Nauffe and Scribbler, 150-1 Pink Gin and Spuffington, 200-1 Over</p>
<p>The Stream, 250-1 Don't Light Up</p>
